\\"motivation\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"The current EX-stage ALU is fully combinational and includes RV32M divide\\\\\\\\nand remainder operators in its worst-case path. On the Tang Nano 20K that\\\\\\\\nlogic is likely much slower than the add/shift/branch hot path, yet\\\\\\\\nCoreMark's timed region is dominated by list/state/matrix work and appears\\\\\\\\nto use division only in cold setup code. If the divider stops limiting Fmax,\\\\\\\\na small stall cost on rare DIV/REM instructions should buy a net fitness\\\\\\\\ngain.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"hypothesis\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Replace the single-cycle combinational DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU logic with a small\\\\\\\\niterative divider in EX, while keeping ADD/logic/shift/branch and the\\\\\\\\nmultiply family on the existing fast path. EX would assert a busy condition\\\\\\\\nonly for divide/remainder ops, hold younger stages until the result ... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_finish\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778812131804,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d689cffbffeShv80JosZNBy9u\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e297719da001YCiSIo6N8OwW5u\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"tool-calls\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"509caba115a58918f9a29bb3900ee3e886c7063e\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e29767244001WKy5Rh2S3ec5RN\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d689cffbffeShv80JosZNBy9u\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":46305,\\\"input\\\":4095,\\\"output\\\":236,\\\"reasoning\\\":2038,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":39936}},\\\"cost\\\":0}}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_start\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778812133133,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d689cffbffeShv80JosZNBy9u\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e29771f0d001WsMLtlntJdGHR6\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e29771a19001zQnOssQE4pmEhm\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d689cffbffeShv80JosZNBy9u\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"509caba115a58918f9a29bb3900ee3e886c7063e\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778812188587,\\\"se