},\"output\":\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260515-003-r11s2.log</path>\\n<type>file</type>\\n<content>\\n1: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_start\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827608915,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a6343520019QvQePHXH23mSA\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a633e710015tPPAcGE54x3vB\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"d3afe3414d7c46c672663a5aedfb3550c60f1868\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}}\\n2: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827623294,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a6377f8002f7IgokbstwK0Xz\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a633e710015tPPAcGE54x3vB\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Reading the bench lessons and prior predictor experiments first so the hypothesis stays off the paths that already regressed.\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1778827622392,\\\"end\\\":1778827623293},\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"openai\\\":{\\\"itemId\\\":\\\"msg_0c9a487eec9684a6016a06c166456c819b86d7fd231f026e3c\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"}}}}\\n3: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827623367,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"call_DU6okipxBZ0mRo94J0ZHMTl7\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/LESSONS.md\\\",\\\"offset\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\":400},\\\"output\\\":\\\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/LESSONS.md</path>\\\\n<type>file</type>\\\\n<content>\\\\n1: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-001-r1s0 (improvement, +21.46%): Moving DIV/REM off the combinational EX ALU into a busy/stall iterative unit can improve FPGA fitness when CoreMark's timed loop is divider-cold, because shortening the add/shift/branch critical path buys more Fmax than the rare long-op stalls cost.\\\\n2: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-002-r1s1 (regression, +16.65%): On this core's combinational IF/ID frontend, even a tiny stall-only replay buffer plus `fetch_available` hazard gating cost more than the synthetic `io_imemReady` bubbles it hid, so fetch-side caching is not a free IPC win.\\\\n3: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-003-r1s2 (regression, -15.17%): On this bench core, pushing even a static backward-branch predictor into IF by decoding `imem_data`, building the B-immediate, and muxing `next_pc` there costs more fitness than the loop-bubble savings, so frontend critical-path growth is a tighter constraint than branch IPC.\\\\n4: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-001-r2s0 (regression, +6.35%): Splitting `MULH`/`MULHU`/`MULHSU` out of `alu.sv` into an `ex_long_busy` helper regressed, so cold-op offloading only helps when timing reports show those variants are actually on the critical path and not when the extra EX stall/result-retime control becomes the new cost.\\\\n5: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-002-r2s1 (improvement, +12.09%): When `io_dmemReady` bubbles dominate and IF timing is already tight, a one-entry MEM-side pending-store slot for aligned normal-RAM stores can improve fitness... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n4: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827623388,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"grep\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"call_t2dny2eavGJNnhKpEFQOVvZc\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"pattern\\\":\\\"predict|Predict|branch|BTB|BHT|RAS|backedge|return\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/experiments\\\",\\\"include\\\":\\\"log.jsonl\\\"},\\\"output\\\":\\\"Found 17 matches\\\\n/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl:\\\\n  Line 2: {\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"hyp-20260514-001-r1s0\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"title\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Move DIV/REM Off The ALU Critical Path\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"category\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"micro_opt\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"motivation\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"The current EX-stage ALU is fully combinational and includes RV32M divide\\\\\\\\nand remainder operators in its worst-case path. On the Tang Nano 20K that\\\\\\\\nlogic is likely much slower than the add/shift/branch hot path, yet\\\\\\\\nCoreMark's timed region is dominated by list/state/matrix work and appears\\\\\\\\nto use division only in cold setup code. If the divider stops limiting Fmax,\\\\\\\\na small stall cost on rare DIV/REM instructions should buy a net fitness\\\\\\\\ngain.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"hypothesis\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"motivation\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"The current EX-stage ALU is fully combinational and includes RV32M divide\\\\\\\\nand remainder operators in its worst-case path. On the Tang Nano 20K that\\\\\\\\nlogic is likely much slower than the add/shift/branch hot path, yet\\\\\\\\nCoreMark's timed region is dominated by list/state/matrix work and appears\\\\\\\\nto use division only in cold setup code. If the divider stops limiting Fmax,\\\\\\\\na small stall cost on rare DIV/REM instructions should buy a net fitness\\\\\\\\ngain.\\\\\\\\n\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"hypothesis\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Replace the single-cycle combinational DIV/DIVU/REM/REMU logic with a small\\\\\\\\niterative divider in EX, while keeping ADD/logic/shift/branch and the\\\\\\\\nmultiply family on the existing fast path. EX would assert a busy condition\\\\\\\\nonly for divide/remainder ops, hold younger stages until the result is ready,\\\\\\\\nthen rel... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n5: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_finish\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827623519,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a637c5c001S1cKywtmoSR1SD\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"tool-calls\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"d3afe3414d7c46c672663a5aedfb3550c60f1868\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a633e710015tPPAcGE54x3vB\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":43538,\\\"input\\\":26962,\\\"output\\\":190,\\\"reasoning\\\":514,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":15872}},\\\"cost\\\":0}}\\n6: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_start\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827625048,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a638256001m7eD4sCG1TzCZs\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a637cb1001U9yIIuWP3TGWp8\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"d3afe3414d7c46c672663a5aedfb3550c60f1868\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}}\\n7: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827704508,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a64b4a5001r3tlJk4icSUZ2V\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a637cb1001U9yIIuWP3TGWp8\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"The predictor history is uniformly negative when it touches IF or adds a guaranteed bubble. I'm narrowing to a predictor that stays off `pc -> next_pc` entirely and uses prediction to justify retiming branch resolution later, trading a rarer mispredict penalty for a shorter hot EX redirect path.\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1778827703461,\\\"end\\\":1778827704507},\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"openai\\\":{\\\"itemId\\\":\\\"msg_04c689141b75efd1016a06c1b757608198a495f972c7795f84\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"}}}}\\n8: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827705609,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"glob\\