direction machin... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n20: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_finish\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827799034,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a6629f8001xkFTmx9dN6JPKp\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"tool-calls\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"d3afe3414d7c46c672663a5aedfb3550c60f1868\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a6612b7001kJevRXPOHco6A6\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":65797,\\\"input\\\":4716,\\\"output\\\":120,\\\"reasoning\\\":33,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":60928}},\\\"cost\\\":0}}\\n21: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_start\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827800694,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a663075001aLIZm7dONqNCuM\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a662a6e001eDIERGlvbmiRhg\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"d3afe3414d7c46c672663a5aedfb3550c60f1868\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}}\\n22: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827806902,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a664732001qZ3skp2y1uR7rO\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a662a6e001eDIERGlvbmiRhg\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Wrote `cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-003-r11s2.yaml`.\\\\n\\\\nHypothesis chosen: an ID-stage exact `JAL` redirect predictor that pulls only unconditional PC-relative jumps one stage earlier, avoiding the IF-path and branch-direction costs that caused the prior predictor regressions.\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1778827806514,\\\"end\\\":1778827806901},\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"openai\\\":{\\\"itemId\\\":\\\"msg_0b5cbb05c0995749016a06c21e678081999f772b9f0b09de61\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"final_answer\\\"}}}}\\n23: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_finish\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827807011,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a664920001v6v6gXXgn5O2DY\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"stop\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"d3afe3414d7c46c672663a5aedfb3550c60f1868\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a662a6e001eDIERGlvbmiRhg\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-finish\\\",\\\"tokens\\\":{\\\"total\\\":66636,\\\"input\\\":962,\\\"output\\\":74,\\\"reasoning\\\":64,\\\"cache\\\":{\\\"write\\\":0,\\\"read\\\":65536}},\\\"cost\\\":0}}\\n\\n(End of file - total 23 lines)\\n</content>\",\"metadata\":{\"preview\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"step_start\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827608915,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a6343520019QvQePHXH23mSA\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a633e710015tPPAcGE54x3vB\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"snapshot\\\":\\\"d3afe3414d7c46c672663a5aedfb3550c60f1868\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"step-start\\\"}}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827623294,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"id\\\":\\\"prt_e2a6377f8002f7IgokbstwK0Xz\\\",\\\"messageID\\\":\\\"msg_e2a633e710015tPPAcGE54x3vB\\\",\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Reading the bench lessons and prior predictor experiments first so the hypothesis stays off the paths that already regressed.\\\",\\\"time\\\":{\\\"start\\\":1778827622392,\\\"end\\\":1778827623293},\\\"metadata\\\":{\\\"openai\\\":{\\\"itemId\\\":\\\"msg_0c9a487eec9684a6016a06c166456c819b86d7fd231f026e3c\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"commentary\\\"}}}}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827623367,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"call_DU6okipxBZ0mRo94J0ZHMTl7\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/LESSONS.md\\\",\\\"offset\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\":400},\\\"output\\\":\\\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/LESSONS.md</path>\\\\n<type>file</type>\\\\n<content>\\\\n1: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-001-r1s0 (improvement, +21.46%): Moving DIV/REM off the combinational EX ALU into a busy/stall iterative unit can improve FPGA fitness when CoreMark's timed loop is divider-cold, because shortening the add/shift/branch critical path buys more Fmax than the rare long-op stalls cost.\\\\n2: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-002-r1s1 (regression, +16.65%): On this core's combinational IF/ID frontend, even a tiny stall-only replay buffer plus `fetch_available` hazard gating cost more than the synthetic `io_imemReady` bubbles it hid, so fetch-side caching is not a free IPC win.\\\\n3: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-003-r1s2 (regression, -15.17%): On this bench core, pushing even a static backward-branch predictor into IF by decoding `imem_data`, building the B-immediate, and muxing `next_pc` there costs more fitness than the loop-bubble savings, so frontend critical-path growth is a tighter constraint than branch IPC.\\\\n4: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-001-r2s0 (regression, +6.35%): Splitting `MULH`/`MULHU`/`MULHSU` out of `alu.sv` into an `ex_long_busy` helper regressed, so cold-op offloading only helps when timing reports show those variants are actually on the critical path and not when the extra EX stall/result-retime control becomes the new cost.\\\\n5: - 2026-05-14 hyp-20260514-002-r2s1 (improvement, +12.09%): When `io_dmemReady` bubbles dominate and IF timing is already tight, a one-entry MEM-side pending-store slot for aligned normal-RAM stores can improve fitness... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778827623388,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\