l_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778829152675,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d588058affeZWwx64D7A1sL53\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"call_lGL0GWJl6nVgmrQ0SCVb4dPW\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-002-r12s1.yaml\\\",\\\"offset\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\":200},\\\"output\\\":\\\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/hyp-20260515-002-r12s1.yaml</path>\\\\n<type>file</type>\\\\n<content>\\\\n1: id: hyp-20260515-002-r12s1\\\\n2: title: \\\\\\\"Hot/Cold Pipeline Payload Split\\\\\\\"\\\\n3: category: structural\\\\n4: motivation: |\\\\n5:   The structural ideas that added logic to IF or made the pending-store slot\\\\n6:   smarter mostly regressed, which points away from more control speculation or\\\\n7:   more MEM arbitration. But the current bench core still pushes a very wide\\\\n8:   payload through `id_ex_t`, `ex_mem_t`, and `mem_wb_t` every cycle, even\\\\n9:   though the hot forwarding, redirect, and memory-service logic only consumes a\\\\n10:   subset of those fields and the rest exist mainly for RVFI retirement\\\\n11:   bookkeeping. On a small FPGA, that always-hot register width and routing can\\\\n12:   cost Fmax even when IPC is unchanged.\\\\n13: hypothesis: |\\\\n14:   Split the interstage state into a narrow execution pipe and a parallel RVFI\\\\n15:   shadow pipe. Keep the current 5-stage control flow, single-retire contract,\\\\n16:   pending-store behavior, and EX-stage branch/JALR resolution exactly the same,\\\\n17:   but stop carrying retirement-only metadata on the hot execute/memory bundle.\\\\n18:   Concretely, shrink the always-hot `id_ex`, `ex_mem`, and `mem_wb` payloads to\\\\n19:   only the fields required for operand forwarding, ALU/div execution, memory\\\\n20:   access, and writeback, while moving instruction bits, raw source addresses and\\\\n21:   values, and other RVFI-only bookkeeping into sideband shadow registe... (line truncated to 2000 chars)\\n35: {\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool_use\\\",\\\"timestamp\\\":1778829152678,\\\"sessionID\\\":\\\"ses_1d588058affeZWwx64D7A1sL53\\\",\\\"part\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tool\\\",\\\"tool\\\":\\\"read\\\",\\\"callID\\\":\\\"call_HopcyNud8TYa8TQt3CjU63RO\\\",\\\"state\\\":{\\\"status\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"input\\\":{\\\"filePath\\\":\\\"/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260515-003-r11s2.log\\\",\\\"offset\\\":1,\\\"limit\\\":200},\\\"output\\\":\\\"<path>/Users/bonetto/bonetto/auto-arch-tournament/.claude/bench-runs/gpt-5_4_xhigh-rep1/cores/bench/experiments/hypotheses/.agent.hyp-20260515-003-r11s2.log</path>\\\\n<type>file</type>\\\\n<content>\\\\n1: {\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"step_start\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":1778827608915,\\\\\\\"sessionID\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"part\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"prt_e2a6343520019QvQePHXH23mSA\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"messageID\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"msg_e2a633e710015tPPAcGE54x3vB\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sessionID\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"snapshot\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"d3afe3414d7c46c672663a5aedfb3550c60f1868\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"step-start\\\\\\\"}}\\\\n2: {\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"timestamp\\\\\\\":1778827623294,\\\\\\\"sessionID\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"part\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"id\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"prt_e2a6377f8002f7IgokbstwK0Xz\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"messageID\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"msg_e2a633e710015tPPAcGE54x3vB\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"sessionID\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ses_1d59cc256ffemzPwtz6CRSLfTQ\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Reading the bench lessons and prio