d against post-synthesis timing and area rather than inferred from RTL types alone.\nhyp-20260710-001-r5s0\tFactor the EX control-flow target adder\tregression\t-17.77\t380.38\t165.45\t- 2026-07-10 hyp-20260710-001-r5s0 (regression, -17.77%): Explicitly naming a shared `pc + imm` target in `always_comb` did not guarantee EX adder/routing reduction and regressed CoreMark, so datapath factoring must be validated after synthesis rather than assumed from RTL common-subexpression structure.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
