ruction into ID/EX.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Validate predicted loop next-PC behavior against the resolved conditional branch, redirect on mismatch, and preserve alignment traps and RVFI pc_next semantics.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": false, \"error\": \"formal_failed: insn_beq_ch0\\ngine_0/trace.vcd\\nSBY 14:20:48 [insn_bne_ch0] summary:   failed assertion rvfi_testbench._witness_.check_flatten_checker_inst__assert_rvfi_insn_check_sv_198_153 at rvfi_insn_check.sv:198.6-198.31 step 20\\nSBY 14:20:48 [insn_sub_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\nSBY 14:20:48 [insn_bne_ch0] DONE (FAIL, rc=0)\\nSBY 14:20:48 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:01:01  waiting for solver (1 minute)\\nSBY 14:21:38 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:01:50  Status: passed\\nSBY 14:21:38 [reg_ch0] engine_0: finished (returncode=0)\\nSBY 14:21:38 [reg_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: pass\\nSBY 14:21:38 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:01:51 (111)\\nSBY 14:21:38 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:01:35 (95)\\nSBY 14:21:38 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned pass\\nSBY 14:21:38 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 did not produce any traces\\nSBY 14:21:38 [reg_ch0] DONE (PASS, rc=0)\\n\\nFormal: 46 passed, 7 failed\\nFailed: insn_beq_ch0 insn_bge_ch0 insn_bgeu_ch0 insn_blt_ch0 insn_bltu_ch0 insn_bne_ch0 pc_fwd_ch0\\n\\n--- insn_beq_ch0/logfile.txt (last 30 lines) ---\\nSBY 14:19:50 [insn_beq_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 7..\\nSBY 14:19:50 [insn_beq_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 8..\\nSBY 14:19:50 [insn_beq_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 9..\\nSBY 14:19:50 [insn_beq_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 10..\\nSBY 14:19:50 [insn_beq_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 11..\\nSBY 14:19:50 [insn_beq_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 12..\\nSBY 14:19:50 [insn_beq_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 13..\\nSBY 14:19:50 