ken and target with the consumed instruction into ID/EX.\"}, {\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Compare the resolved JALR return target with the carried prediction token and redirect only on mismatch or an unpredicted return, retaining alignment-trap behavior.\"}], \"outcome\": \"broken\", \"formal_passed\": false, \"cosim_passed\": false, \"error\": \"formal_failed: pc_fwd_ch0\\n trace to Verilog testbench: engine_0/trace_tb.v\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:18  Writing trace to constraints file: engine_0/trace.smtc\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:18  Writing trace to Yosys witness file: engine_0/trace.yw\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:18  Status: failed\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] engine_0: finished (returncode=1)\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] engine_0: Status returned by engine: FAIL\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed clock time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:19 (19)\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] summary: Elapsed process time [H:MM:SS (secs)]: 0:00:16 (16)\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] summary: engine_0 (smtbmc bitwuzla) returned FAIL\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] summary: counterexample trace: reg_ch0/engine_0/trace.vcd\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] summary:   failed assertion rvfi_testbench._witness_.check_flatten_checker_inst__assert_rvfi_reg_check_sv_42_56 at rvfi_reg_check.sv:42.6-42.59 step 20\\nSBY 15:48:10 [reg_ch0] DONE (FAIL, rc=0)\\n\\nFormal: 51 passed, 2 failed\\nFailed: pc_fwd_ch0 reg_ch0\\n\\n--- pc_fwd_ch0/logfile.txt (last 30 lines) ---\\nSBY 15:47:52 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 8..\\nSBY 15:47:52 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 9..\\nSBY 15:47:52 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 10..\\nSBY 15:47:52 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 11..\\nSBY 15:47:52 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 12..\\nSBY 15:47:52 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 13..\\nSBY 15:47:52 [pc_fwd_ch0] engine_0: ##   0:00:00  Skipping step 14