nstruction and decoded control.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Compare the resolved branch next PC with the carried prediction and generate redirect only for a conditional-branch misprediction, preserving misalignment traps and RVFI next-PC semantics.\"\nHYPOTHESIS_FILE_OK\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
