 \"Integrate the BTB/BHT lookup and EX update path, while preserving the existing imem/dmem and RVFI contracts.\"\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: \"Select a trained BTB target for eligible conditional branches, with redirect, stall, flush, and sequential-fetch priority rules intact.\"\n  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n    description: \"Propagate the IF prediction metadata through the ID/EX register alongside decoded instruction state.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Compare resolved branch next-PC behavior against the carried prediction and generate redirects only for conditional-branch mispredictions, retaining jump and trap behavior.\"\n1:id: hyp-20260710-003-r2s2\n3:category: predictor\n21:  fitness_delta_pct: 4\n24:  - file: rtl/branch_predictor.sv\n26:  - file: rtl/core_pkg.sv\n28:  - file: rtl/core.sv\n30:  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n32:  - file: rtl/id_stage.sv\n34:  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
