>\"Propagate direct-call prediction metadata through the ID/EX register without altering architectural decode controls.\"}, {\"file\"=>\"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\"=>\"Compare a predicted direct-call target with the resolved JAL target and suppress only an exact-match recovery redirect while preserving trap and RVFI next-PC behavior.\"}]}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
